    "description": "<p>This quiz checks which programming concepts you already know, so that we can adapt the course. You will see your score afterwards, but not the correct answers&mdash;the course will teach you those. The score does not affect your grade. Please answer on your own, without help from others or from tools.</p>",
    <<course start-quiz placement>>
    <<scheduling settings>>
    <<interaction settings>>
    <<score-only result view>>
  },
  "questions": [
    <<consent question>>,
    <<aspect groups>>
  ]
}
@

