\subsection{The topic quizzes}

Each topic pair brackets one teaching unit in the learning study: the
start quiz runs immediately before the unit, the end quiz immediately
after.
The topic banks \emph{are} the course groups, reused by reference, so
the two levels cannot drift apart: an item improved for a topic quiz
is improved for the course quiz, automatically.
The eight pairs are identical in structure, so we define them together;
only the bank and the placement in the course differ, and the placement
is the subject of \cref{app:diagnostics-placement}.
Two pairs bank more than one analysis, because the course teaches the
topics together: dictionaries arrive in the same week as classes, and
the containers pair revisits every container of the course, the
function-and-list aspects of the debugging chapter included.

