\paragraph{Aspect 31: the loop variable must change in the body.}
The critical aspect is that the condition's variable must be updated
inside the loop, or the condition never changes --- the
\emph{control variable is never changed} antipattern
\autocite{Bosse2021Antipatterns,Eckert2022Loops}.
The counts-up distractor encodes assuming the loop advances its
variable by itself.

